<title>USA: Scott Cty PPC, Ky., won by J.J.B. Hilliard.</title>
<headline>Scott Cty PPC, Ky., won by J.J.B. Hilliard.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.J.B. Hilliard, W.L. Lyons said it won $3.385 million of Scott Cty PPC, Ky., lease revenue refunding bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.8407 percent.</p>
</text>
